  "question": {
    "text": "A Carnot engine, having an efficiency of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">η</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>10</mn></math> as a heat engine, is used as a refrigerator. If the work done on the system is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math>, the amount of energy absorbed from the reservoir at a lower temperature is"
  },
