  "solution": {
    "text": "Relation between coefficient of performance and efficiency of refrigerator is<br /><br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#951;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#951;</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math><br /><br />Coefficient of performance, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>Heat</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>absorbed</mi><mo>(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>Work</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>done</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mn>10</mn></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>90</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math>"
  }
